//RS //! User-facing syntax dictionary.
//RS //!
//RS //! Rows start with `JET_HIGHLIGHT_TOKENS`, which already references the
//RS //! canonical `Syntax` constants. Decision IDs come from those constants'
//RS //! source comments or the applied-rule registry; no second token list exists.
